      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Presented maintained to an exceptional standard, this well presented four/five-bedroom detached family home offers bright, spacious accommodation in a peaceful low-density development just minutes from Mullingar town centre. Ready for immediate occupation, this home combines generous living space with quality finishes throughout, making it an ideal choice for growing families.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance porch leading to a spacious entrance hall with under-stairs storage. The ground floor features a bright dual-aspect sitting room with a solid fuel stove, a separate living room, and a versatile office/playroom with fitted storage that could also serve as a fifth bedroom. The spacious kitchen is fitted with an excellent range of wall and floor units and is complemented by a solid fuel stove, while the adjoining utility room provides additional storage and direct access to the rear garden. A fully tiled ground floor shower room completes the accommodation on this level.\r\nUpstairs, a bright landing leads to four generously proportioned bedrooms, three of which are spacious doubles. The principal bedroom benefits from a modern en-suite, while the remaining bedrooms are served by a well-appointed family bathroom featuring both a bath and separate shower.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a private, secluded rear garden, detached garden shed and gated side access. To the front, there is ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within walking distance of Mullingar town centre, the property enjoys immediate access to schools, shops, sporting facilities, restaurants and everyday amenities. The C-Link Road, N4 motorway and the Royal Canal Greenway are all close by, ideal for commuters and outdoor enthusiasts alike.\r\n\r\nOffering spacious accommodation in a good location, this is a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in one of Mullingar's most convenient residential settings. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nPorch 1.836m x 0.792m (6' x 2'7\"): \r\nTiled flooring, coat rack, double glazed slider door.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall 3.075m x 3.573m (10'1\" x 11'9\"): \r\nTiled floor, under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 2.909m x 2.76m (9'7\" x 9'1\"): \r\nSide aspect, laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room 4.188m x (13'9\" x): \r\nLaminate flooring, spotlights, TV point, dual aspect, solid fuel stove with marble base.\r\n\r\nOffice/Storage Room \r\n2.618m x 2.308m (8'7\" x 7'7\"): \r\nLaminate flooring, front aspect, built in wardrobes, ample storage space.\r\n\r\nKitchen 6.589m x 3.064m (21'7\" x 10'1\"): \r\nTiled floor, fitted wall and floor units, oven/hob with tiled splashback, sink, solid fuel stove.\r\n\r\nUtility Room 2.293m x 2.546m (7'6\" x 8'4\"): \r\nTiled floor, door to rear, plumbed for washer & dryer, shelved storage presses.\r\n\r\nGuest Shower Room \r\n1.544m x 2.237m (5'1\" x 7'4\"): \r\nTiled throughout, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, fan, mirror, shower cubicle with power shower.\r\n\r\nLanding 3.109m x 4.363m (10'2\" x 14'4\"): \r\nLaminate floor, access to attic, large window.\r\n\r\nBedroom One 3.176m x 4.104m (10'5\" x 13'6\"): \r\nLaminate flooring, dual aspect, double room.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 3.112m x 3.116m (10'3\" x 10'3\"): \r\nSide aspect, laminate flooring, double room, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 3.031m x 3.153m (9'11\" x 10'4\"): \r\nSide aspect, laminate flooring, double room.\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Four 2.33m x 5.287m (7'8\" x 17'4\"): \r\nCarpet flooring, front aspect, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite 1.551m x 2.276m (5'1\" x 7'6\"): \r\nTiled throughout, wash hand basin with vanity unit, shower cubicle with power shower.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.859m x 1.955m (9'5\" x 6'5\"): \r\nTiled flooring, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, shower cubicle with triton T90SR unit, mirror with light, bath, towel rail, fan, access to attic.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features & Services\r\n•Detached four/five-bedroom family home\r\n•Turnkey condition throughout\r\n•Bright and spacious accommodation\r\n•Versatile office/playroom or fifth bedroom\r\n•Spacious fitted kitchen with solid fuel stove\r\n•Utility room with excellent storage\r\n•Two modern shower rooms including en-suite\r\n•Oil-fired central heating\r\n•New boiler installed approximately two years ago\r\n•Underfloor heating in entrance hall\r\n•House dry-lined and walls pumped for improved efficiency\r\n•Wired for alarm\r\n•Bluetooth speaker system in ground floor bathroom\r\n•Detached garden shed\r\n•Private secluded rear garden\r\n•Gated side access\r\n•Ample off-street parking\r\n•Low-density family-friendly development\r\n•Royal Canal Greenway directly across the road\r\n•Approximately 10-minute walk to Mullingar town centre\r\n•Easy access to the C-Link Road and N4 motorway\r\n•Close to schools, shops and all local amenities\r\n\r\nIncluded\r\n•Carpets\r\n•Curtains\r\n•Blinds\r\n•Fixtures and fittings\r\n•Light fittings\r\n•Dishwasher\r\n•Oven/hob"
      },
